      "message": "test(ui): pin that tool kind glyphs are painted on catalog rows and picker items\n\nTwo kittests read the frame's textured shapes and assert each catalog row\nand each opened picker item paints its kind's glyph texture level with its\nlabel (rows scrolled into view first); deleting either glyph call fails\nthem. The tool_of_kind comment no longer claims a valid tool.\n\nFixes #1226\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
